request.description:
Returns aggregated quality metrics across all modules.
Requires: reports:read (via authorize('reports','read'))

Response fields:
- generated_at: ISO timestamp
- tenant_id: UUID
- capa: { open, overdue, critical, closed_30d, new_30d, avg_days_to_close, on_time_rate }
- training: { total_assignments, completed, in_progress, overdue, compliance_rate }
- documents: { total, effective, draft, in_review, review_overdue, review_upcoming, currency_rate }
- suppliers: { total, approved, pending, suspended, expiring_soon, avg_score }
- health_score: 0-100 composite score

Verified: 200, health_score=100, 13 documents (5 draft, 3 effective)

No auth headers at all.
Expected: 401 { code: 'MISSING_TOKEN', message: 'Authentication token is required', hint: '...' }

Verified: 401 MISSING_TOKEN

Malformed JWT.
Expected: 401 { code: 'INVALID_TOKEN' }

Verified: 401 INVALID_TOKEN
